WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.933 --> 00:00:15.038
Izzie and Nina burst into Kids Central.

2
00:00:15.058 --> 00:00:18.740
"Guess what, Miss Shelly!"

3
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:19.720
Nina said.

4
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.881
"Tomorrow is the fourth-grade field trip!"

5
00:00:23.582 --> 00:00:26.523
"We're going to the aquarium," Izzie said.

6
00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:28.304
"I can't wait."

7
00:00:29.716 --> 00:00:31.317
She spun around on one foot.

8
00:00:31.337 --> 00:00:35.640
"We went last year when we were in fourth grade," Jason said.

9
00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.261
"It was lots of fun."

10
00:00:38.983 --> 00:00:41.324
"I can't wait to see all the frogs!"

11
00:00:41.905 --> 00:00:42.525
Izzie said.

12
00:00:43.846 --> 00:00:44.927
Jason shook his head.

13
00:00:44.947 --> 00:00:47.609
"They don't have frogs there, Izzie.

14
00:00:48.589 --> 00:00:49.650
Just sea creatures."

15
00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:51.852
Izzie froze.

16
00:00:51.872 --> 00:00:57.596
"What?" "No frogs," Jason repeated.

17
00:00:59.036 --> 00:00:59.916
Izzie hung her head.

18
00:01:00.817 --> 00:01:02.157
Nina patted her on the back.

19
00:01:02.177 --> 00:01:07.279
"Let's get started on our activity," Miss Shelly said.

20
00:01:07.299 --> 00:01:10.661
"We're actually going to make sea creatures today."

21
00:01:13.362 --> 00:01:15.963
Bobby pointed to a can of shaving cream on the table.

22
00:01:15.983 --> 00:01:17.824
"Will they have beards?"

23
00:01:18.984 --> 00:01:20.004
Miss Shelly laughed.

24
00:01:20.445 --> 00:01:26.347
"Nope. We're going to use that shaving cream to make puffy paint."

25
00:01:27.307 --> 00:01:28.668
"What's puffy paint?"

26
00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:29.781
Ethan asked.

27
00:01:29.801 --> 00:01:35.666
"My mom and I make puffy paint sometimes," Nina said.

28
00:01:35.686 --> 00:01:38.108
"It's light and foamy.

29
00:01:38.628 --> 00:01:41.251
It's fun to make stuff with puffy paint."

30
00:01:41.271 --> 00:01:47.916
"The first step is to put 1/4 cup of white glue in a bowl," Miss Shelly said.

31
00:01:47.936 --> 00:01:49.578
"Izzie, can you do that?"

32
00:01:49.598 --> 00:01:51.880
"Okay," Izzie said.

33
00:01:57.817 --> 00:02:01.119
"Now we squirt in some paint," Miss Shelly said.

34
00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:04.242
Nina squirted pink paint into the glue.

35
00:02:05.723 --> 00:02:07.845
She stirred until the mixture was light pink.

36
00:02:09.366 --> 00:02:11.167
"Do we add the shaving cream now?"

37
00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:12.368
Jason asked.

38
00:02:12.388 --> 00:02:15.131
"Yes," Miss Shelly said.

39
00:02:15.151 --> 00:02:17.152
"We need 1/4 cup."

40
00:02:19.114 --> 00:02:21.176
Jason carefully added the shaving cream.

41
00:02:21.196 --> 00:02:25.399
"There! Pink puffy paint!"

42
00:02:25.799 --> 00:02:26.400
Nina said.

43
00:02:27.636 --> 00:02:30.178
The kids quickly mixed another bowl of paint.

44
00:02:30.198 --> 00:02:33.962
"What kind of sea creature are we making?"

45
00:02:34.302 --> 00:02:35.063
Ethan asked.

46
00:02:35.083 --> 00:02:39.206
"An octopus."

47
00:02:41.068 --> 00:02:43.530
Miss Shelly handed everyone a sheet of craft foam.

48
00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.172
"Cut out an octopus body."

49
00:02:50.516 --> 00:02:52.497
"Should we cut out eight legs too?"

50
00:02:52.778 --> 00:02:53.618
Jason asked.

51
00:02:54.579 --> 00:02:55.220
"Not yet."

52
00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:58.741
Miss Shelly gave everyone some bubble wrap.

53
00:02:58.761 --> 00:03:01.243
"First we'll paint.

54
00:03:02.284 --> 00:03:05.446
Paint your octopus body and this bubble wrap."

55
00:03:06.987 --> 00:03:08.067
Izzie started painting.

56
00:03:08.367 --> 00:03:09.108
She smiled.

57
00:03:10.069 --> 00:03:10.889
Nina was right.

58
00:03:11.309 --> 00:03:12.870
The paint felt light and foamy.

59
00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:16.393
"Puffy paint takes a while to dry."

60
00:03:16.953 --> 00:03:18.774
Miss Shelly held up a deck of cards.

61
00:03:19.394 --> 00:03:21.536
"We can play Go Fish while we wait."

62
00:03:26.252 --> 00:03:29.133
When the paint was dry, Izzie touched hers gently.

63
00:03:29.153 --> 00:03:31.214
"Nice and puffy."

64
00:03:32.854 --> 00:03:34.935
Miss Shelly showed the kids what to do next.

65
00:03:34.955 --> 00:03:40.196
"Cut the bubble wrap into eight strips for the octopus's legs.

66
00:03:47.879 --> 00:03:51.080
Then glue the legs onto the back of the body."

67
00:03:57.356 --> 00:03:59.898
Izzie reached for scissors and started cutting strips.

68
00:04:01.219 --> 00:04:02.100
Pop! Pop!

69
00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.022
She giggled as some plastic bubbles popped.

70
00:04:07.564 --> 00:04:11.747
While everyone glued, the fifth-graders told the fourth-graders about the aquarium.

71
00:04:11.767 --> 00:04:15.690
"You can touch stingrays," Jason said.

72
00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:19.933
"And watch a diver feed sharks," Ethan said.

73
00:04:19.953 --> 00:04:23.496
"The penguins are cool," Bobby said.

74
00:04:26.268 --> 00:04:27.869
Izzie squinted at her octopus.

75
00:04:27.889 --> 00:04:31.071
"Something is missing, Miss Shelly."

76
00:04:31.091 --> 00:04:35.514
"Eyes!" Miss Shelly gave everyone two plastic eyes.

77
00:04:39.257 --> 00:04:42.779
saw a real octopus at the aquarium last year," Jason said.

78
00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:45.141
He looked at the girls and sighed.

79
00:04:45.161 --> 00:04:47.462
"You two are so lucky.

80
00:04:48.423 --> 00:04:50.024
I wish I was going on the field trip!"

81
00:04:51.145 --> 00:04:52.025
Izzie smiled.

82
00:04:52.045 --> 00:04:55.508
"We'll tell you all about it tomorrow."
